# Site vs archive

The marketing site lives at `/` (Italian) and `/en/` (English). It owns the public chrome (header, footer, styles).

`/archivio/` is an unlinked owner archive of old photos and texts. Do not add it to nav, footer, or any public page. It already sends `noindex`.
